cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: LLM Guard Bench — Automated Adversarial Attack Benchmark Suite
abstract: |
  An early-stage, open-source framework for evaluating the robustness of language
  models against adversarial prompts (jailbreaks and prompt injection). It sends
  attacks to a target model, scores responses with a keyword heuristic and an LLM
  judge, and stores results in SQLite. Under active development: the evaluation
  methodology is still being validated and results should not be treated as
  definitive safety measurements.

